WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.127
- Here are the things
that run through my mind.

00:00:01.127 --> 00:00:04.346
I would say the primary thing 
I probably ask myself is, "Is this

00:00:04.346 --> 00:00:07.702
"actually gonna lead to somebody
showing up at my funeral?"

00:00:07.702 --> 00:00:10.345
If you really ask me what
the fuck I do for a living,

00:00:10.345 --> 00:00:13.079
it's that I'm trying to create
a legacy because I'm either

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:17.095
A, so egotistical
that I want that.

00:00:17.095 --> 00:00:17.658
- Yep.

00:00:17.658 --> 00:00:20.423
- Or B, love
human beings so much,

00:00:20.423 --> 00:00:22.790
'cause I do and I think that's
why I've popped on social.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:23.780
- [Nickolas] Yeah.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:28.269
- So I think a lot of what I
think about is what's the legacy

00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:29.449
of this manuever.
- Yeah.

00:00:29.449 --> 00:00:32.208
- Like right now, this
is fucking stupid for me.

00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:34.024
Doing an interview
with you for 15 minutes,

00:00:34.024 --> 00:00:36.276
is fucking ridiculous.
- I love it, I love it.

00:00:36.276 --> 00:00:40.188
- It makes no God damn sense but
I'm feeling pretty good about

00:00:40.188 --> 00:00:43.445
the odds of maybe this leading
to you showing up to my funeral.

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:47.408
That's how I think about stuff,

00:00:47.408 --> 00:00:51.211
so I'm very big
on what it is impact,

00:00:52.481 --> 00:00:55.715
how does it impact me
and more importantly the other

00:00:55.715 --> 00:00:58.815
person in the narrative that 
I care about which is I think

00:00:58.815 --> 00:01:00.915
I was gifted with
some real crazy shit.

00:01:01.682 --> 00:01:06.097
- Enough talent to be able to do
my thing for me and still have

00:01:06.097 --> 00:01:08.595
so much left
over to give so much.

00:01:08.595 --> 00:01:10.690
- To give, yeah, yeah.
- That to me is crazy.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:14.310
(upbeat music)

00:01:00.915 --> 00:01:01.682
- [Nickolas] Yeah.

